/-!
# The rest of the register run beside the answer: the fields `nQ3a`, `zQ3a` of `DecSep`

Research note `N-22`. After the cut, the rest of the register run (its region, then the circuit and
the lanes) is far from the stations `0 … j - 1` and from the answer: from the answer on its line
by the certificates `<p>AnsFar` of the split runs (the answer box lies in the moving box
`<p>AnsF`), from the stations and their relay footprints by the generated checks
`dsepT_<L>_st` (generated by `scripts/life_cert/emit_dsep_st.py`).

* `dsepT_nQ3a`, `dsepT_zQ3a`: the fields `nQ3a`, `zQ3a` (after the end of the run, the
  circuit and the lanes: `dsepT_grpLanes_far`).
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace LeanTheory.Life

open Finset LeanTheory.Computability

namespace LP

variable {p : Program} {i r z : ℕ}

set_option linter.unusedTactic false
set_option linter.unreachableTactic false

